{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/e5b25cd7c843ed0f197a3a3219dd216b.avif?t=1768305335\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if, at this very moment, a fluffy little cat peeked out from the edge of your screen, blinking those big, round eyes at you\u2014wouldn\u2019t you just want to reach out and pet it? It might lazily roll over, showing its soft belly, purring happily~ And this healing moment isn\u2019t just for one cat. You\u2019ll have an entire family of kitties quietly living at the bottom of your desktop. They won\u2019t make a fuss; just be there, offering warmth whenever you glance down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/69de951967e58925cafed915971c94ee.poster.avif?t=1768305335\" width=800 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/69de951967e58925cafed915971c94ee.webm?t=1768305335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/69de951967e58925cafed915971c94ee.mp4?t=1768305335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/200dac35b18b4ae6bc08e4418e24522d.avif?t=1768305335\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These cats are nothing like the ones you\u2019ve seen before! Not only are they fluffy and adorable, needing your care, they also turn into brave little warriors, using yarn balls and Meow Punch to earn coins and fish treats for you! Enjoy watching your cats automatically gather coins and treats for you! All the coins you collect can be used to evolve your cats or decorate their little home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/791f3e24cec4c020fd732ae70c4f32f4.poster.avif?t=1768305335\" width=800 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/791f3e24cec4c020fd732ae70c4f32f4.webm?t=1768305335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/791f3e24cec4c020fd732ae70c4f32f4.mp4?t=1768305335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/480d6d9dd499b9d8091366d923282e05.avif?t=1768305335\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember the excitement of picking out the first toy for your cats? As soon as the scratcher is placed, an energetic<strong> </strong>kitty will rush over, stretching out tiny paws to try it out! Sleepy cats will curl up into a fluffy ball on the soft blankets you\u2019ve laid out. An empty room slowly fills with memories you share with your cats, turning it into a unique, heartwarming little home just for the two of you~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/c75c98fb896df8ba168b4eb8e2be3405.poster.avif?t=1768305335\" width=800 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/c75c98fb896df8ba168b4eb8e2be3405.webm?t=1768305335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/c75c98fb896df8ba168b4eb8e2be3405.mp4?t=1768305335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/5a271181ed0d6d074d71bd0f25199b79.avif?t=1768305335\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of kitty will you meet next? Playful and energetic, lazy and gluttonous, quiet companions\u2026 Different colors, personalities, and stories are waiting for you to discover! Even better, each merge and evolution lets you watch them grow into even cuter, more charming forms! Aren\u2019t you ready to experience the joy of collecting and bonding as a proud catkeeper?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/078c3a2bae400c1d4e5b8d1353d7fc19.poster.avif?t=1768305335\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/078c3a2bae400c1d4e5b8d1353d7fc19.webm?t=1768305335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/078c3a2bae400c1d4e5b8d1353d7fc19.mp4?t=1768305335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803720/extras/144f05b19d722ee6d9f113720b47ed32.avif?t=1768305335\" width=616 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve got cat cans, toys, soft cushions\u2026 The kitties are perking up their ears and wagging their tails, sitting in a row\u2014 All that\u2019s missing is you! Come an